", "headline": "11/8 清晨稜線 GFS 體感降到 -3 °C", "detail": "獵寮這晚體感最低 ECMWF 2.2 °C（01:00）、GFS 0.1 °C（04:00）；往嘉明湖、三叉山那段 GFS 05–06 點 -1.6～-1.7 °C、07:00 三叉山 -3.0 °C，ECMWF 2.3–3.1 °C，兩邊差到 5 度。傍晚降雨機率七成多但雨量不到 1.5 mm，ECMWF 21 點後、GFS 半夜前停，凌晨降雨機率一成多，GFS 風速約 2 m/s。氣象署一週預報還沒涵蓋這晚。", "basis": "Open-Meteo ECMWF／GFS（10/31 08:28 查詢）（11/7 18:00–11/8 07:00）", "assessed_at": "2026-10-31T08:30+08:00"}, {"id": "confidence", "order": 5, "topic": "預報可信度", "level": "caution", "headline": "距出發 6 天，中等可信度", "detail": "第一晚兩模式這版靠攏，11/8 清晨反而拉開到 5 度，還會再跳。氣象署一週預報已涵蓋 11/6，今天下午那版會到 11/7，11/1 下午涵蓋 11/8，之後以氣象署為主。", "basis": "Open-Meteo 兩模式比較、氣象署一週預報（最遠 11/6）", "assessed_at": "2026-10-31T08:30+08:00"}]}, "itinerary": {"rows": [{"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T10:00", "event": "起登", "place": "戒茂斯登山口", "elev_m": 1883}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T10:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山前峰", "elev_m": 2065}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T12:10", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T12:00", "event": "經過", "place": "戒茂斯山", "elev_m": 2510}, {"day": "DAY 1", "time": "2026-11-06T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-06T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T07:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T08:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "新武呂溪營地", "elev_m": 2208}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T11:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T11:00", "event": "經過", "place": "足球場營地", "elev_m": 2769}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T15:00", "event": "經過", "place": "嘉明湖妹池", "elev_m": 3150}, {"day": "DAY 2", "time": "2026-11-07T15:30", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-07T16:00", "event": "抵達營地", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T04:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T04:00", "event": "拔營出發", "place": "獵寮營地", "elev_m": 3130}, {"day": "DAY 3", "time": "2026-11-08T06:00", "forecast_hour": "2026-11-08T06:00", "event": "日出", "place": "嘉明湖